# Confusticate and Bebother, second mode: "Draw two cards, then discard a card." Bot1 draws Plains and Swamp (the top two cards),
# then discards the Plains it chooses, keeping the Swamp and its three Islands: the discard comes after both draws (the Plains
# is in hand when chosen), so the hand is the Islands and the Swamp, net one card up on the three it held (CR 121.1, 701.9).
# The scenario is cast on Bot1's own turn 1 off the three Moxen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Confusticate and Bebother
Island
Island
Island
Plains
Swamp
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Confusticate and Bebother.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Draw two cards)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Plains)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Confusticate and Bebother; Plains
Bot1.Library.Count = 20
